This directory mirrors MRST's layout and is intentionally empty.

It corresponds to `modules/deckformat/resultinput/private` in the MRST 2024a tree. Nothing here is ported
yet; the folder exists so the two trees can be compared side by side and so
a port lands in the place its MATLAB original occupies.

Git does not track empty directories, which is the only reason this file
exists. Delete it when real code arrives.
